  "description": "Hoping to reunite with the senior she had a crush on, Lee-seo has been working for four years at Atlas Robotics, where he is the CEO. On a night when she finally reaches her breaking point and decides to submit her resignation, she finds a familiar yet unfamiliar figure standing at her doorstep. It's none other than her unrequited crush, Jung Tae-gyeom... No, wait, is he an android?   \n\n\"Lee-seo, I think I'm malfunctioning a bit right now. I need you to check it out.\"  \n\n\"What? Where?\"    \n\n\"My genitals are hard.\"  \n\n\"What?\"\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14496670)",
